OL,3,GNEWSAMan and daughter who dumped body
OL,4,Ain canal jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnslow was jailed for life for murder
OL,7,Fwith a minimum term of 26 years while
OL,8,FFerguson, who was convicted of
OL,9,Fassisting an offender and preventing a
OL,10,Flawful and decent burial, was given six
OL,11,Fyears in prison.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
